description:
Several panels sharing one region, one shown at a time.

  Tabs(default_value: "overview") do
    TabsList do
      TabsTrigger(value: "overview") { "Overview" }
      TabsTrigger(value: "activity") { "Activity" }
    end
    TabsContent(value: "overview") { "A snapshot of your workspace." }
    TabsContent(value: "activity") { "Every change, newest first." }
  end

Each trigger is matched to the panel with the same `value:`. The root shares `variant:` (:pill, :line), `size:` and `orientation:`; the selected tab is rendered on the server, and the `ui--tabs` controller switches panels, slides the indicator and handles the arrow keys. Emits `ui--tabs:change` with { value }.

examples.code:
phlex do
  Tabs(default_value: "overview", variant:, size:, orientation:, class: "w-full max-w-md") do
    TabsList { PANELS.each { |value, (label, _)| TabsTrigger(value:) { label } } }
    PANELS.each { |value, (_, text)| TabsContent(value:, class: "text-foreground-muted text-sm") { text } }
  end
end

